## Every screen is checked for

Design · empty · loading · error · validation · no permission · role-specific states · every control works ·
the server agrees · emails · widths/devices.

## Always-on edge cases

- Double click / double tap on anything that saves or pays
- Two tabs saving the same thing
- Empty, too long, wrong-format input
- Slow or no network; server error
- Expired links; Back button in the middle of a flow
- Opening a page by its address without permission
- Time zones (dates saved a day early or late)
- Same account signed in on two devices
{{#if has_payments}}
- Card declined, then retried; paying twice
{{/if}}
